Open a SQL session:
  exasol connect{{ .DeploymentSelection }}
{{- if .MCPEndpoint }}

Show setup instructions for your AI client:
  exasol mcp instructions{{ .DeploymentSelection }}
{{- else if .SuggestMCP }}

Optional: use this database with an AI assistant.
Enable the MCP server:
  exasol mcp enable{{ .DeploymentSelection }}
{{- end }}

When you're finished, stop the deployment:
  exasol stop{{ .DeploymentSelection }}
{{ else if eq .DeploymentState "stopped" }}
Deployment stopped.

Next steps:
{{ nextSteps (print "exasol start" .DeploymentSelection) "restart the deployment"
  (print "exasol destroy" .DeploymentSelection) "delete provisioned resources" }}
{{ else if eq .DeploymentState "deployment_failed" }}
Deployment failed.

Next steps:
{{ nextSteps (print "exasol deploy" .DeploymentSelection) "retry provisioning after fixing the problem"
  (print "exasol destroy" .DeploymentSelection) "clean up resources" }}
{{ else if eq .DeploymentState "interrupted" }}
Deployment operation interrupted.

Next steps:
